<quote xml:id="idq3" corresp="#idq31"><hi rendition="#aq">&#x201E;Beshrew me, if I would do such a wrong the whole<lb/>
world</hi> <note place="foot" n="*)"><cit><quote corresp="#idq3" type="translation" xml:id="idq31">&#x201E;Jch will des Todes &#x017F;ein, thät ich &#x017F;olch&#x2019; Unrecht.<lb/>
